  "StockRole": "Skirmisher",
  "YangsThoughts": "Clan Coyote built the Canis as a second-line 'Mech that leans on energy weapons, because their OmniMechs kept running dry on ammunition in the longer fights against the Inner Sphere. It's an eighty-ton machine on an Endo Steel chassis with an XL engine, so there's plenty of tonnage left for armor and a heavy weapons load. The catch is speed, since it's slower than most 'Mechs its size, and it runs hot enough that pilots have to keep an eye on the heat even with all those double heat sinks.",
